---
// "Private by design", with the app's own consent dialog (its texts at PreCut 6b2636a).
import { app } from "../../config";
---

<section class="border-y border-white/5 bg-ink-1/60">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-20 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Private by design
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg/85">
        Your videos, photos and projects stay on your phone. There's no account,
        no ads and no analytics.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg/85">
        Cloud AI is optional, and {app.name} asks before every upload. Then only
        the sound is sent, never the picture, and {app.name}'s server keeps no
        audio and no words.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/privacy"
        class="mt-6 inline-block py-2 text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-2"
      >
        Read the privacy policy
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal flex justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="dialog">
        <p class="title">Send a test phrase?</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>What:</strong> a test phrase your phone just spoke,
            <span class="font-mono">3</span>&nbsp;s long
            (<span class="font-mono">96</span>&nbsp;KB). Only sound.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Where:</strong>
            {app.name}'s server in Ireland, then ElevenLabs turns it into words.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Kept:</strong>
            {app.name}'s server keeps no audio or words. ElevenLabs handles it
            under its own privacy policy.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions">
          <span class="cancel">Cancel</span>
          <span class="send">Send</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dialog {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 22rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--color-ink-2);
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px -20px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.8),
      0 0 80px -30px rgb(255 77 109 / 0.5);
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--color-fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .actions span {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
  }
  .cancel {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .send {
    background: var(--color-accent-fill);
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
